.Dd February 27, 2026
.Dt IR-DIFF 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm ir-diff
.Nd semantic diff for textual SSA IR modules after normalization
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar left.ir right.ir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
normalizes both IR inputs and compares normalized output.
Differences are reported independent of superficial formatting.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 2
.It 0
Normalized IR is equivalent.
.It 1
IR differs or parse/verify failed.
.It 2
Invalid command usage.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ir-verifier 1 ,
.Xr ir-normalize 1 ,
.Xr cc 1
